mode: "100644"
text: "# The REPLY framework — a Threads post built for conversation\n\nThreads rewards what most platforms only claim to: genuine conversation. **Replies outweigh likes**, and\nMosseri's rule is **\"reply more than you post.\"** REPLY writes the post AND is honest that the post is the\nsmaller half. **WoopSocial publishes the post**; the **replying that wins reach is a human job**.\n\n## R — Reason to reply\n- Write a **conversation starter**: a question, a hot take, a genuine opinion — give people something to\n  respond to. **Not** a broadcast or press release. (Avoid engagement bait — it's penalized + dishonest.)\n\n## E — Engagement velocity first\n- The **first 30–90 min** decide distribution. **Post at a peak window** (schedule it there) and **be ready\n  to reply fast** — early replies compound into For You reach.\n\n## P — Personality + niche\n- **Authentic, human, original** (credibility/originality are rewarded; polished promo is suppressed). Keep\n  a **consistent niche** and add **one primary topic tag** so the topic-neighbourhood AI categorizes you.\n\n## L — Light media + link if it fits\n- **Photos out-engage text-only (~+60%)**; video <30s with captions works. **Links are now rewarded** —\n  put them **inline** (no first-comment tax). Stay within **500 characters.** Media supports the\n  conversation; it doesn't replace the reason to reply.\n\n## Y — You reply more than you post\n- The post is the **smaller half**; the **replies are where reach is won.** **WoopSocial publishes/schedules\n  the post**; a **human (or `community-management`) does the replying** — there's no reply surface in the API.\n  Draft reply angles so the human can move fast.\n\n## The Threads post a request should fill\n```\nANGLE: the conversation starter (question / hot take / opinion); niche fit + goal (replies/profile visits)\nPOST: <=500 chars, human voice, one reason to reply; one topic tag; optional photo/video; inline link if useful\nVELOCITY: schedule to a peak window; reply plan for the first 30-90 min\nPUBLISH (WoopSocial): single Threads text/media post (no chain/poll/voice/GIF via API); validate before publish\nREPLY WORK (human / community-management): the half that drives reach; metrics from native analytics (never fabricated)\n```\n"
